    pr_ref:  # b053
    description: "In the DEEP bakeoff diagnose output, orphan_rate is calculated with a wrong denominator. Example: livekit shows orphan_count=3 but orphan_rate=100.0% — this is 3/3 (number of reverse-slice seeds or similar), not 3/4567 (total nodes). The HIGH_ORPHAN_RATE threshold fires spuriously, inflating WARN verdicts and making diagnostics less trustworthy. Several repos show >50% orphan rates that are not meaningful: tmux (67%), guacamole-client (86%), workadventure (93%), livekit (100%), bun (51%). Fix: use total_nodes as denominator, or change to absolute orphan_count threshold."  # b053
    fields: {}  # b053
